00:19:29.970 --> 00:19:36.520
But, that means he thought of me as an adult, so...

00:19:36.520 --> 00:19:40.830
So, I'm not sad at all.

00:19:42.160 --> 00:19:43.660
I'm not sad at all.

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:57.820
I'm not a kid anymore.

00:19:58.860 --> 00:20:03.690
Because of something like this... 
Because of something as small as this...

00:20:03.690 --> 00:20:05.430
...I'm not gonna cry.

00:20:10.420 --> 00:20:11.930
You're so silly.

00:20:12.400 --> 00:20:16.200
Even adults cry from a broken heart.

00:20:16.200 --> 00:20:17.920
It's okay to cry.

00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:42.670
It's okay.

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:45.090
School is fun too.

00:20:45.090 --> 00:20:47.160
And I've made a new friend as well.

00:20:47.630 --> 00:20:51.950
By the way, mum, have you ever done something like confess?

00:20:53.630 --> 00:20:55.870
When dad proposed to you?

00:20:55.870 --> 00:20:58.290
I don't mean that.

00:20:58.290 --> 00:21:00.700
Well, I mean...

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:02.510
Like when you were still a school student.

00:21:03.160 --> 00:21:05.700
Why am I asking?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:08.200
No reason in particular.

00:21:08.200 --> 00:21:12.860
No, I don't have a girl I like!

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:16.740
It's true. It's not like that.

00:21:18.040 --> 00:21:20.710
It's not like that...

00:21:25.610 --> 00:21:27.680
Time flows slowly.

00:21:27.730 --> 00:21:30.230
At Futago Oka(Twin Hills) overlooking the small town...

00:21:30.230 --> 00:21:34.280
There, a story passed down from bygones, the Legend of the Sakuras.

00:21:34.280 --> 00:21:39.670
At the Yatsushiro temple, tens of years ago, was a Shinto ritual made to be forgotten.

00:21:39.670 --> 00:21:44.810
Hidden in the darkness of the unblooming Sakuras is a pair of eyes.

00:21:44.810 --> 00:21:49.120
Next time on Myself; Yourself: 
The Unblooming Sakuras.

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:52.010
Do you have a wish you want fulfilled?

00:21:49.120 --> 00:21:55.230
The Unblooming Sakuras

00:21:52.010 --> 00:21:54.980
Say Shuri, I think you got the wrong TV show.
